; The dawn phrase (chosen 2026-07-02 from three candidates, auditioned in
; sequence with fanfare_held). chime_dusk's falling bell reversed — the
; motif rises, then G5 leans on the dominant so the fanfare's C answers
; it. Plays with the dawn sweep, before fanfare_held.

phrase chime_dawn        ; dusk's bell answered — light returns
  C5 400ms               ; where dusk ended, the ground note
  rest 8
  E5 300ms               ; the answer rises the motif
  rest 4
  G5 550ms               ; opens toward morning — the fanfare completes it
